Package: urbanheatisland
Type: Package
Title: Land Surface Temperature, Interpolated Air Temperature, and Spatial Hotspot Analysis
Version: 0.12.0
Authors@R: person("Alf", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "alf@ibe.cnr.it")
Description: Tools to acquire and process MODIS Land Surface Temperature (LST) data
    (via the NASA AppEEARS API or local files), interpolate ground-station air
    temperature observations to continuous raster surfaces (IDW, Kriging, TPS,
    TIN, nearest-neighbour), derive urban heat island (UHI) metrics by combining
    LST and interpolated air temperature, downscale air temperature using LST as
    a covariate, and run local spatial hotspot analysis (Getis-Ord Gi*, Local
    Moran's I) on raster surfaces. Designed for urban heat island and
    biometeorological workflows (e.g. MIRifICUS).
